sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant SvelteKit
    participant BetterAuth as Better Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Browser->>SvelteKit: Sign in with email and password
    SvelteKit->>BetterAuth: Authenticate credentials
    BetterAuth->>DB: Read account and password hash
    alt Authenticator enrolled
        BetterAuth-->>Browser: Ask for second factor
        Browser->>BetterAuth: Authenticator or recovery code
        BetterAuth->>DB: Verify code, create session
    else Not enrolled
        BetterAuth->>DB: Create session
    end
    BetterAuth-->>Browser: Session cookie
    Note over Browser,SvelteKit: Administrators without MFA are sent to enrollment first
    Browser->>SvelteKit: Request ticket
    SvelteKit->>BetterAuth: Validate session
    BetterAuth-->>SvelteKit: User and session
    SvelteKit->>DB: Reload account and role grants
    SvelteKit->>SvelteKit: Check enabled, capabilities, ownership
    SvelteKit->>DB: Authorized ticket query
    DB-->>SvelteKit: Ticket rows
    SvelteKit-->>Browser: Only allowed fields
